{"v":4,"catch":"為美女而設的原創動作遊戲又回了Nintendo Switch上!","desc":"在80年代首次發佈並獲得歡迎的側滾動bishojo動作遊戲系列 \"Valis\"，在2021年12月慶祝其35週年。\n\n為了紀念這一點，該系列最受歡迎的三款PCEngine™遊戲，\"Valis: The Fantasm Soldier\"、\"Valis II\"和 \"Valis III\"，已經完全移植到了Nintendo Switch上!\n\n包括聲音模式和視覺模式!\n遊戲配備了觀看模式，讓你可以欣賞到《Valis》的寶石聲音和美麗的視覺場景!\n此外，許多其他元素使你能夠充分享受《Valis》，如允許你在任何地方保存和加載的功能，以及允許你回去重做任何錯誤的 \"倒帶 \"功能。","publisher":"Edia","release":"2022-02-10","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.0GB / Switch 1.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ba7f187ec3e3a30a1c4e757c80043e368c787abc432404862dc9c35e86165d25.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5feb8baf5ed8c83fae07ac1a3eaecbafb1ac1e61822283cce41d8df997b276f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c98913d1a00d35f28cc6cf8edea35613d8a9245067ccb5fe5acb183cdd55f3fa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/427802331665822b31d78d3db3b2dedc444bf7631a89d2a920a58bec9df76ae4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/557a973ae301253d92869fd1acb0ecbe6ce3c72544a5ab6fe2878f76e9481a76.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fcf7e9b1badaecaaedc7143d047a0f3fe3b3e485a686373c838f2a4391893f68.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a3d016acc000","dlc":[]}